---
// Short about.
---
<section class="section section--band" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h2 id="about-h">Operator, not spectator.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about__body">
      <p>
        I am Smatthew Cohen. I run IngeniumVector, where I design and operate the
        automation and AI systems behind small businesses that want to move faster
        without hiring for it.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        The work is hands-on: I build the pipelines, wire the integrations, and stay
        on the hook while they run. If a system cannot prove it worked, I treat it as
        broken until it can.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about { display: grid; gap: var(--gap); }
  @media (min-width: 52rem) { .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr; align-items: start; } }
  .about__body { max-width: 60ch; }
</style>
